SUMMARY:Deadline 16:00 UK — UKRI Enabling AI adoption across science an
 d engineering (UKRI)
DESCRIPTION:Up to £250k FEC\, 12-month exploratory projects pairing AI e
 xperts with domain researchers to embed AI in science and engineering.\n
 \nEffort: moderate (8-10 days intensive).\n\nWhat you need:\n• Check i
 nternal research office deadline — Research office must check and subm
 it via the Funding Service\n• Core team and co-lead — Pair an AI exp
 ert with a non-AI domain expert\n• Summary — 550 words\, plain Engli
 sh\n• Vision and Approach PDF — 4 A4 sides\, 11pt Arial\, 2cm margin
 s\, plus 1 workplan page\n• Team capability statement — Word limit s
 et in the Funding Service\, typical — confirm in the guidance\n• Res
 ources and cost justification — FEC costing\; no PhD costs\; equipment
  under £25k per item\n• Ethics and RRI section — Typical — confir
 m in the guidance\n• Nominate DPR reviewers — Review about eight pro
 posals\, or your application is rejected\n\nhttps://www.ukri.org/opportu
 nity/ukri-enabling-ai-adoption-across-science-and-engineering/
URL:https://www.ukri.org/opportunity/ukri-enabling-ai-adoption-across-sci
 ence-and-engineering/
