UID:scheme-msca-postdoctoral-fellowships-deadline@wave-research
DTSTAMP:20261123T121712Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270909
SUMMARY:Deadline — Marie Sklodowska-Curie Postdoctoral Fellowships 2027
  (European Commission (Marie Sklodowska-Curie Actions))
DESCRIPTION:EU-funded fellowships of 12-24 months (European Fellowships) 
 for researchers with a PhD and up to eight years of research experience 
 to carry out their own project at a host in another country\, prepared j
 ointly with the host supervisor.\n\nEffort: moderate (5-8 days over abou
 t 3 months).\n\nWhat you need:\n• Eligible candidate — PhD by the de
 adline\, eight years of research experience or less\, and compliant with
  the 12-in-36-months mobility rule\; hosting offers can be advertised on
  Euraxess.\n• Jointly written proposal — Developed by the candidate 
 with the host\; template and page limits are in the guide for applicants
  (typical\; confirm in the 2027 guide).\n• Supervisor and host descrip
 tion — Supervision\, training and career-development arrangements and 
 facilities (typical\; confirm in the 2027 guide).\n• Candidate CV — 
 In the call template (typical\; confirm in the 2027 guide).\n• Host or
 ganisation submission — The host submits through the EU Funding & Tend
 ers Portal\, so research-office sign-off is needed.\n• Optional non-ac
 ademic placement — Up to 6 months at a non-academic organisation can b
 e added at the end of the fellowship.\n\nhttps://marie-sklodowska-curie-
 actions.ec.europa.eu/funding/msca-postdoctoral-fellowships-2027
URL:https://marie-sklodowska-curie-actions.ec.europa.eu/funding/msca-post
 doctoral-fellowships-2027
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Deadline — Marie Sklodowska-Curie Postdoctoral Fellowships 
 2027 (European Commission (Marie Sklodowska-Curie Actions))
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
