 esearch experience or less\, and compliant with the 12-in-36-months mobi
 lity rule\; hosting offers can be advertised on Euraxess.\n• Jointly w
 ritten proposal — Developed by the candidate with the host\; template 
 and page limits are in the guide for applicants (typical\; confirm in th
 e 2027 guide).\n• Supervisor and host description — Supervision\, tr
 aining and career-development arrangements and facilities (typical\; con
 firm in the 2027 guide).\n• Candidate CV — In the call template (typ
 ical\; confirm in the 2027 guide).\n• Host organisation submission —
  The host submits through the EU Funding & Tenders Portal\, so research-
 office sign-off is needed.\n• Optional non-academic placement — Up t
 o 6 months at a non-academic organisation can be added at the end of the
  fellowship.\n\nhttps://marie-sklodowska-curie-actions.ec.europa.eu/fund
 ing/msca-postdoctoral-fellowships-2027
