UID:ukri-173818-start@wave-research
DTSTAMP:20261123T121712Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270402
SUMMARY:Start preparing (round expected\, dates not announced) — Access
  to high performance computing facilities: autumn 2025 (UKRI)
DESCRIPTION:Effort: light (3-5 days over two weeks).\n\nWhat you need:\n
 • Choice of HPC service — Name one service and\, if you wish\, a res
 erve (10 words)\; contact the service early to check your request is rea
 listic\, as it runs a technical assessment if you succeed\n• Resource 
 request — Quantity and units (CU\, CPUh\, GPUh or node-hours) in 20 wo
 rds\; no more than 50% of the resource available on that system\n• Cas
 e document — One document with your responses to all the criteria: 2 s
 ides of A4 for requests up to 300k CU\, 2M CPUh\, 50k GPUh or 200k node-
 hours\, 3 or 4 sides for larger requests\; single-spaced 11-point Arial\
 , margins of at least 2cm\, references included\; over-length applicatio
 ns are rejected\n• Diagrammatic work plan — One optional extra page 
 with a timeline of work packages\n• Summary — 550 words\, in plain E
 nglish\n• Core team and keywords — Project lead\, co-leads and other
  roles\; three keywords\n• HEC consortium statement (ARCHER2 only) —
  100 words if you belong to a funded HEC consortium\, explaining why you
  are not applying through it\n• Research office check and submission 
 — UKRI Funding Service (not Je-S)\; applications cannot be changed onc
 e sent\, and one rejected for substantive errors cannot be resubmitted t
 o that round\n\nhttps://www.ukri.org/opportunity/access-to-high-performa
 nce-computing-facilities-autumn-2025/
URL:https://www.ukri.org/opportunity/access-to-high-performance-computing
 -facilities-autumn-2025/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Start preparing (round expected\, dates not announced) — Ac
 cess to high performance computing facilities: autumn 2025 (UKRI)
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
