 ty to deliver — 1\,650 words\n• Project partner details — Enter ov
 erseas collaborators and their contributions under 'Project partner'\, n
 ot in the core team\; they fund their own involvement apart from travel 
 and subsistence\n• Costings — Up to £100\,000 FEC\; no PhD students
 hips\, conference attendance\, equipment of £25\,000 or more\, or partn
 er salaries\n• FAPESP or NSTC paperwork (only for São Paulo or Taiwan
  partners) — Title prefix 'NERC-FAPESP' or 'NERC-NSTC'\; attach the FA
 PESP SAGe submission or the completed NSTC budget form as a PDF\n• Sum
 mary and research office submission — 550-word plain-English summary\;
